# Log Truncation Cleanup Workflow

1. Identify all batchLog lines in src/services/batch/BatchWriteService.ts and other relevant files that use .slice() or any character limits on fields.
2. Remove all instances of .slice() and similar methods from the identified log lines.
3. Check and remove any remaining truncations in src/services/batch/CronService.ts and src/services/evaluation/RuleEvaluator.ts.
4. Verify that no truncated fields are logged in ollama_metadata.log by removing any relevant `.slice()` or similar operations there.
